<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Flight Booking Confirmation</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f6f8;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .email-container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 20px;
        border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      }

      h2 {
        color: #007bff;
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      .section-title {
        background-color: #f1f1f1;
        padding: 10px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .info-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .info-table td {
        padding: 8px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      }

      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
        padding: 10px;
      }

      .highlight {
        color: #28a745;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <h2>Flight Booking Confirmation</h2>
      <p>Dear {{passenger_name}},</p>
      <p>Your flight has been successfully booked. Below are the details of your trip:</p>

      <div class="section-title">Flight Details</div>
      <table class="info-table">
        <tr>
          <td>Flight Number:</td>
          <td>{{flight_number}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Departure:</td>
          <td>{{departure_city}} ({{departure_airport}}) at {{departure_time}} on {{departure_date}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Arrival:</td>
          <td>{{arrival_city}} ({{arrival_airport}}) at {{arrival_time}} on {{arrival_date}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Class:</td>
          <td>{{flight_class}}</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <div class="section-title">Passenger Information</div>
      <table class="info-table">
        <tr>
          <td>Full Name:</td>
          <td>{{passenger_name}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Email:</td>
          <td>{{passenger_email}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Phone:</td>
          <td>{{passenger_phone}}</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <div class="section-title">Payment Summary</div>
      <table class="info-table">
        <tr>
          <td>Amount Paid:</td>
          <td class="highlight">{{payment_amount}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Payment Method:</td>
          <td>{{payment_method}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Transaction ID:</td>
          <td>{{transaction_id}}</td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <p>We wish you a pleasant journey. If you have any questions, feel free to contact our support team.</p>

      <div class="footer">
        &copy; 2025 Siwes Flight Project &bullet; support@siwesflight.com
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
